<p>1.</p>

<p>a. \(pH=-log([H^{+}])=-log(0.2388)=0.62\)</p>

<p class="mt-indent-1">\(K_a=\frac{[H^{+}][A^{-}]}{[HA]} \rightarrow K_a=\frac{[H^{+}]^{2}}{[HA]} \rightarrow [H^{+}]= \sqrt{K_a\times[HA]}=\sqrt{10^{-0.70} \times 0.286\,M}=0.2388\)</p>

<p>b. \(pH=-log([H^{+}])=-log(0.14125)=0.850\)</p>

<p class="mt-indent-1">\(K_a=\frac{[H^{+}][A^{-}]}{[HA]} \rightarrow K_a=\frac{[H^{+}]^{2}}{[HA]} \rightarrow [H^{+}]= \sqrt{K_a\times[HA]}=\sqrt{10^{-0.70} \times 0.100\,M}=0.14125\)</p>

<p>2.</p>

<p>a. \(pH=-log(4.46 \times 10^{-6})=5.35\)</p>

<p>\(K_a=\frac{[C_6H_5O^{-}][H_3O^{+}]}{[C_6H_5OH]}=\frac{x^2}{0.195} \rightarrow 10^{-9.99}=\frac{x^2}{0.195} \rightarrow x=4.46 \times 10^{-6}\)</p>

<p>\(Assumption\,Valid: \frac{4.46 \times 10^{-6}}{0.195\,M} \times 100 \% &lt;5 \%\)</p>

