<p>\(CaHPO4&middot;2H2O: 3.0\,L \times \frac{2.7 \times 10^{-7}\,mol}{1\,L} \times \frac{290.1299\,g}{1\,mol}=2.35 \times 10^{-4}\,g\)</p>

